{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">江西吉安市遂川縣高坪鎮昨日發生泥石流，增至3人死亡、仍有9人失蹤。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.MUDSLIDE-1230.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026RXflxzrn3o1788671690.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.MUDSLIDE-1230.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">消防員上午在高坪鎮明坑村一間倒塌房屋中發現一名失蹤者，但證實死亡。現場目前有至少600名救援人員持續搜救。央視報道指，救援難度在於現場仍不時發生泥石流，救援人員要多次緊急撤離，令搜救一度暫停。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.MUDSLIDE-1230_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026yff2JagCwL1788671684.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.MUDSLIDE-1230_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">不過從遂川縣城通往災區的主要道路已經搶通，為後續救援提供更多保障。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-06T05:38:04.541906+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}